---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Stripes from '../components/Stripes.astro';
import Picture from '../components/Picture.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Us" description="Meet the Clyde High School Community Problem Solving team and learn why we chose health awareness for our 2026–27 project.">
  <section class="page-hero on-dark">
    <Stripes variant="corner" />
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--gold)">Clyde High School CmPS · 2026–27</p>
      <h1>About <span class="script">us</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">We're students on the Clyde High School Community Problem Solving (CmPS) team in Clyde, Texas.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="why-title">
    <div class="wrap about-grid">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2 id="why-title">Why we chose health</h2>
        <p>
          When we began discussing what to work on this school year, we realized many of us had health issues in our families:
          high blood pressure, cancer, a family member on the transplant list, heart attacks. These were very different events,
          but they were all health related, and we wondered if we could encourage our community to think about their health.
        </p>

        <h2>Our underlying problem</h2>
        <blockquote class="problem">
          In 2026–2027, when we noticed the lack of education surrounding various health issues within our community, what can we,
          the Clyde High School Community Problem Solving Team, do to promote health awareness to improve our community's education
          of common health challenges, ultimately resulting in the improvement of the overall quality of life of our citizens?
        </blockquote>

        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <picture class="cisd-logo">
          <source type="image/webp" srcset="/images/clyde-cisd-logo-240.webp 240w, /images/clyde-cisd-logo-480.webp 480w" sizes="160px" />
          <img src="/images/clyde-cisd-logo-240.png" alt="Clyde CISD logo: a bulldog leaping through a gold letter C" width="240" height="213" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </picture>
        <p>
          Community Problem Solving (CmPS) is a program where students find a real problem in their own community and work to fix it.
          Our 2026–27 team is made up of Clyde High students who care about this town and the people in it.
        </p>
        <p>
          We started by asking the community. At our health fair booth in September 2026, we surveyed 50 neighbors.
          Most said our community isn't educated on health concerns, and almost everyone said more education would help.
          <a href="/survey/">See what they told us.</a>
        </p>

        <h2>What we're doing</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Running booths at local events with free health flyers and info.</li>
          <li>Building this website so anyone can learn the basics on a phone in a few minutes.</li>
          <li>Connecting people with local help, like blood donation, organ donor sign-up, and CPR classes.</li>
          <li>Planning a community health fair for Clyde. <a href="/events/">See our events.</a></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="note">
          We're students, not doctors. Everything on this site is for learning only. Please talk to your doctor about your own health.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-photos">
        <figure>
          <Picture
            name="banner-closeup"
            sizes="(min-width: 900px) 30vw, 100vw"
            alt="Close-up of our hand-painted kraft paper banner. 'Clyde' is painted in gold script and 'CmPS' in black letters, with black, gold, and white brush strokes."
          />
          <figcaption>Our hand-painted booth banner.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        {/* TODO: Confirm photo permission with our sponsor (and every student shown) before launch.
             If permission isn't confirmed, delete the two <figure> blocks below. */}
        <figure>
          <Picture
            name="team-at-table"
            sizes="(min-width: 900px) 30vw, 100vw"
            alt="Three CmPS team members smiling behind our booth table, which is covered in health flyers, with the Clyde CmPS banner hanging in front."
          />
          <figcaption>Team members at our health fair booth.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <Picture
            name="team-handing-out"
            sizes="(min-width: 900px) 30vw, 100vw"
            alt="Two CmPS team members at the booth handing out small treats from a basket, with flyers on the table and a Bulldog Band trailer in the background."
          />
          <figcaption>Handing out goodies (and health info!) at the booth.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Stripes />

  <section class="section section--paper">
    <div class="wrap" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.75rem;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between">
      <h2 style="margin:0">Start learning</h2>
      <a class="btn btn--black" href="/#topics">See all 9 health topics <Icon name="arrow-right" size={20} /></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-grid { display: grid; gap: 2.5rem; }
  @media (min-width: 900px) { .about-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.4fr) minmax(0, 1fr); align-items: start; } }
  .problem {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem; padding: 1.25rem;
    background: var(--gold-soft); border: 3px solid var(--black); border-radius: var(--radius); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sticker);
    font-size: 1.15rem; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .about-photos { display: grid; gap: 1.5rem; }
  .cisd-logo { float: right; margin: 0 0 0.75rem 1rem; }
  .cisd-logo img { width: 140px; height: auto; }
  @media (min-width: 560px) { .cisd-logo img { width: 170px; } }
  @media (min-width: 560px) and (max-width: 899px) { .about-photos { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  .about-photos figure { margin: 0; }
  .about-photos img { border-radius: var(--radius); border: 3px solid var(--black); aspect-ratio: 3 / 4; object-fit: cover; width: 100%; }
  .about-photos figcaption { font-family: var(--font-script); font-size: 1.4rem; line-height: 1.2; margin-top: 0.35rem; }
</style>
